    <!-- Disclaimers (§10) -->
    <string name="disclaimer_title">What This App Does &amp; Doesn\'t Do</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_no_band_forcing">This app does NOT force 5G SA, NSA, or carrier aggregation — those are network-controlled decisions outside any app\'s control.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_quic_limit">Download shaping is effective for TCP traffic but has no effect on QUIC/UDP-heavy downloads (e.g., some video streaming over HTTP/3). This is a fundamental protocol limitation, not a bug.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_statistical">The chosen shaping rate is a statistical estimate of near-future network capacity. A sudden, large drop in signal can still cause a brief latency spike before recalibration catches up.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_vpn">This app uses Android\'s VPN interface purely as a local traffic interception mechanism. NO traffic is routed through any remote server. All connections go directly from your device to their real destinations.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_battery">Running a local traffic relay adds some CPU overhead. Battery impact is typically in the low single-digit percentage range during active data use.</string>

